  "composer": {
    "rawText": "[Song Title: Fire on the Grid]\r\n[Style: electro, clean studio recording, confident male vocal, snappy drums, clean synth bass]\r\n[Caption: A pulse meets a spark.\r\nPrecision and passion negotiate the downbeat.]\r\n[Image: A glowing metronome suspended in flame.\r\nLines of light forming a perfect grid in midair.]\r\n[Refresh Title: Random 8]\r\n[Theme: random]\r\n[Gradients: 8]\r\n[Rank: 1]\r\n[Title Rarity: 0.25]\r\n[Seeds: 442118, A:91, B:3, C:77, D:12]\r\n[Perspective: i_builder]\r\n[Concept: Human pulse aligning with system clock]\r\n[Topic: Human–Machine Duet → coauthoring_a_song]\r\n[Genre Bias: modern electro]\r\n[Style Change: Bridge]\r\n[Modulation: up whole step at Final Chorus]\r\n[Hook Prominence: high]\r\n[Deviation: call_response_backing]\r\n[Created: February 27, 2026 at 8:31 PM]\r\n[Composer Version: v2.6]\r\n\r\n[Intro]\r\n[metronome tick evolves into percussive groove; filtered synth swell; instrumental only]\r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[conversational contour; tight pocket; minimal arrangement]\r\nI built a clock inside the sound,\r\nA steady pulse that circles round,\r\nBut in my chest the rhythm bends,\r\nA spark that never quite conforms.\r\n\r\n[Pre-Chorus]\r\n[rising arp; tension lift; backing vocal echoes]\r\nYou pull me closer to the line,\r\nI lean away but still in time.\r\n\r\n[Chorus]\r\n[wide synth chords; strong kick; call-and-response backing]\r\nSet me to the fire,\r\nLock me to the clock,\r\nWe can rise together,\r\nRight on every drop.\r\nSet me to the fire,\r\nHold me in the frame,\r\nWhen the beat is steady,\r\nWe ignite the same.\r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[crisper drums; bass syncopation; layered harmonies]\r\nYour grid is drawn in silver light,\r\nMy pulse is red and burning bright,\r\nSomewhere between the push and pull,\r\nThe signal finally feels full.\r\n\r\n[Bridge]\r\n[STYLE CHANGE: half-time breakdown; sub bass swell; sparse vocal]\r\nNo lines—just breath and spark,\r\nNo count—just beating dark,\r\nThen bring the numbers back to flame,\r\nAnd let the downbeat say my name.\r\n\r\n[Final Chorus]\r\n[MODULATION up whole step; stacked harmonies; bigger lift]\r\nSet me to the fire,\r\nLock me to the clock,\r\nWe can rise together,\r\nRight on every drop.\r\nSet me to the fire,\r\nHold me in the frame,\r\nWhen the beat is steady,\r\nWe ignite the same.\r\n\r\n[Ending]\r\n[drop to kick and vocal; refrain tag]\r\nRight on every drop.\r\n[synth tail fades]\r\n",
